@title Heat legend under a lesson card: the scale lies flat, ticks are readable, the notes below show
@area Cabinet
# The card parked in the bottom right leaves the Temperature legend little height. Its scale then lies flat with thinned ticks, and the notes scroll (solid bar) instead of being cut off.
click_text "Learn…"
wait 15
text cabinet layout
wait 8
click_text Start #1
wait 40
click_text Cabinet #1
wait 40
key shift+h
wait 60
shot legend-under-card
check_blank legend-under-card
expect "Preview from part losses"
check_layout
